# Vercel builds only the web app (Root Directory = web) plus its file: dependency engine/.
# The rest of the monorepo is unused by the web build; excluding it keeps uploads small.
backend
contracts
mobile
# docs/* rather than docs: /litepaper renders docs/litepaper.md at build time, and a
# directory excluded outright cannot have one file let back in. This shape can.
docs/*
!docs/litepaper.md
ops
**/target
**/.next
